# Sync from Nihas (develop)

Repo: local `develop` in **Vasanthgogox/Pulse-app**. Teammate: **nihas-gogox/Pulse-app** `develop`.

Treat these phrases the same: “fetch from nihas”, “pull nihas”, “get nihas changes”, “sync from nihas”, “merge nihas develop”, “pull nihas changes into develop”.

## One-time remote

```bash
git remote -v
```

If `nihas` is missing:

```bash
git remote add nihas https://github.com/nihas-gogox/Pulse-app.git
```

If `nihas` exists but is not that URL, `git remote set-url nihas https://github.com/nihas-gogox/Pulse-app.git`. Never invent remotes. Do not use `nihas-gogox/q-web`.

## Procedure

1. Confirm branch is `develop` (`git branch --show-current`). If not, ask before switching.
2. Protect uncommitted work: stash (including untracked if needed) or warn. Never discard.
3. `git fetch nihas develop`
4. Merge, not rebase, unless asked: `git merge nihas/develop`
5. Success: show `git log -5 --oneline` and `git status`.
6. Conflicts: stop, list files, help resolve. Never `--force`. Never delete local work.
7. Do **not** push to `origin` unless the user explicitly says “push”.
8. Never push to Nihas’s fork. Never rewrite history on shared `develop` unless asked.
